"Shogakukan"},{"animation":false,"id":143,"name":"Mainichi Broadcasting System"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Danseur noble--a ballet dancer qualified to dance the role of the prince. Second-year junior high school student Murao Junpei was fascinated by ballet as a boy, but gave up on dancing after his father's death, as he had to become a man. However, one day, a beautiful transfer student named Godai Miyako appears before him. Miyako takes notice in Junpei's love of ballet and invites him to dance with her. Along with Miyako's cousin Mori Ruou, he begins his career as a full-fledged ballet dancer, with the aim of becoming the world's best dancer--the Danseur noble! Only those who have sacrificed everything are permitted to stand in the beautiful and harsh world of classical ballet. What will be the fate of a total beginner like Junpei?!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"},"tags":[{"name":"Dancing","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ballet","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":70,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Acting","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Incest","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":36,"spoiler":false},{"name":"POV","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Judo","rank":29,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"CGI","rank":17,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":16,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Dance Dance Danseur","english":"Dance Dance Danseur","native":"ダンス・ダンス・ダンスール","romaji":"Dance Dance Danseur","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"舞动不止"}]},"trailer":{"id":"rd0qAYtN8Ck","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rd0qAYtN8Ck/hq